Bring Your Dream Project to Life in Serra da Gardunha
Imagine waking up every day to the majesty of Serra da Gardunha as your backdrop and enjoying the tranquility of an authentic Beira village. In Alcongosta, just a few minutes from Fundão, you’ll find this village house full of history and potential, ready to start a new life.
With 59 m² spread over four floors, this property is the perfect opportunity for anyone looking for a renovation project that could become a unique home, a cozy holiday house, or an investment with high appreciation potential.
The location combines the best of both worlds: the peace and authenticity of country life, with the convenience of all the services and amenities in Fundão. The views of Serra da Gardunha make this property even more special, offering a setting of rare beauty in any season.
If you’re looking for a space where you can unleash your creativity and build a house tailored to you, this is an opportunity worth discovering.

Property highlights:

Village house in need of complete renovation;
Prime location in Alcongosta, near Fundão;
Unobstructed view of the Serra da Gardunha;
4 floors with excellent potential for use;
Building area of 59 m²;
Ideal for your own home, a weekend house, rural tourism, or an investment.
Turn this house into a home full of personality and be part of the beauty and authenticity of Beira Interior. Book your visit now and discover the full potential of this property!

